SYNAPSE OS // RESIDENT FULL ZEREF

This directory contains the immutable QC67 model/runtime assets shipped by the
Synapse image. Mutable conversation memory/state lives in the user's home.
Sanitized IBM provenance lives at /var/lib/synapse/zeref/ibm/latest.json.

The IBM credential is NOT part of this image. An owner may provision it at:
  /etc/synapse/secrets/ibm-quantum-token

Only zeref-ibm-broker.service loads that credential. The resident model process
does not receive it.

Commands:
  synapse zeref status
  synapse zeref doctor
  synapse zeref start
  synapse zeref stop
  synapse zeref chat "hello"
  synapse zeref ibm status
  sudo synapse zeref ibm refresh

A broker refresh retrieves the pinned existing IBM job. It does not submit a
new IBM workload.
